#
# Wireless configuration policy
#
# Wireless stacks (Wi-Fi, Bluetooth/BLE, Thread, Zigbee, coexistence, ...) are
# released as prebuilt libraries. Their CONFIG_* options are fixed by the
# library release and must be selected through Make defconfig only; they are
# intentionally NOT exposed in Kconfig/menuconfig so that customers cannot
# change them at build time.
#
